A moderate day hiking in the rainforest of Springbrook. Expect to get wet, and to run
into leeches. A moderate day walking the Twin Falls circuit. See <a href="https://parks.des.qld.gov.au/__data/assets/pdf_file/0014/162320/springbrook-inset-maps.pdf">National Park Map</a>.

The plan, to share anounymously (through the coach facilitator) ahead of time a page or pitch of your work with a few other writers. As we hike and talk, we get to know each other a bit. At a lunch break, we try to guess the page/pitch with the people in front of us. After the round of guessing, we then go through each attempting to offer some critique. 

If the weather is good, there are a few pools where you can take a swim. Cafe's may be open after the day for a longer or warm lunch. 

Open to writers of all levels. 

Cost, free.